<title>USA: NACCO proration 95.85 pct in Dutch auction.</title>
<headline>NACCO proration 95.85 pct in Dutch auction.</headline>
<dateline>MAYFIELD HEIGHTS, Ohio 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>NACCO Industries Inc said Tuesday that 843,003 shares of Class A common stock were tendered to the company's Dutch auction, which expired December 16.</p>
<p>The number of shares tendered includes 272,831 shares tendered pursuant to guaranteed delivery. Based on preliminary results, the company said it expects to purchase 800,000 shares of Class A common stock for $50 per share.</p>
<p>The company estimates the proration factor to be about 94.85 percent.</p>
</text>
